1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,197
This love in my heart,
it will burn on forever.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:09,037
Granting me courage, I
hope it will never stop.

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:12,177
No matter where you
are, nothing is too far.

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:15,857
With our everlasting bones,
we'll reach it, we are home.

5
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:22,637
I'm

6
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,917
so truly grateful.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,820
I ran into you on that day so long ago.

8
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,397
We laughed every moment
with tears in our eyes.

9
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:34,880
Till we knew we weren't alone.

10
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:41,840
The blowing wind came in
and joined us on our way.

11
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:47,097
And with it I know we'll rise.

12
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:49,797
We'll be flying up high.

13
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,900
Why, tell me why are you giving up?

14
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:56,080
Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?

15
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,620
Hey, what kind of future
do you think you have?

16
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:03,197
Your dream is already in your hands.

17
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,917
This love in my heart,
it will burn off forever.

18
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,757
Granting me courage, I
hope it will never stop.

19
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:13,897
No matter where you
are, nothing is too far.

20
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:16,457
With our everlasting
promise, we'll reach it.

21
00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:18,737
We are home from the horizon.

22
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:20,537
Out on the edge of the world.

23
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:23,477
There is a place that
I want to take you to.

24
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,897
Let's head for it then.

25
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:28,520
But as for the way, we already know.

26
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:31,600
We promised it long ago.

27
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:45,317
You scream by your voice.

28
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,237
That can't break through the silence.

29
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,817
Feeling defeated.

30
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:51,037
It crushes your helpless heart.

31
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,697
I've got your back, I swear.

32
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,177
I'll always be here.

33
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:57,960
Let's put our fate within
this light under the sun.

34
00:01:58,940 --> 00:02:02,880
Can you close your eyes and
just listen to my voice?

35
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,097
Let's find the answer together.

36
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:07,577
I'm telling you in our path.

37
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:09,617
I trust that it will lead us.

38
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:11,517
To another sea untarded.

39
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,417
Cause now we are home.

40
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:16,147
On the horizon, out on
the edge of the world.

41
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:19,217
There is a place I want to take you to.

42
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:20,697
Let's head for it then.

43
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:24,260
The last of the way we already know.

44
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:27,300
We promised it long ago.

45
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:35,177
Off we go.

46
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:38,517
This is awesome every single time.

47
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,577
You said it.

48
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:41,560
Shadow of the Ring.

49
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:45,797
Oh yeah.

50
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:49,400
It's the Sharks of Merge.

51
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:02,967
Pedro and I will take care of
the mission, so don't you worry.

52
00:03:03,860 --> 00:03:04,690
Sorry, Luffy.

53
00:03:04,773 --> 00:03:09,446
I know I said I'd do this on my own, but
it looks like I'll be borrowing Brooke.

54
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:14,497
Infiltration is somewhat of
a specialty of mine, Pedro.

55
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:16,500
I'm sure I'll be of use to you.

56
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:20,840
I'll find that horny cliff
in a spooktacular fashion.

57
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:22,920
Sweet! Good luck!

58
00:03:23,180 --> 00:03:24,768
I know you can handle this.

59
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:28,417
After we meet up with Sanji and Pudding,
we'll wait here for you to come back.

60
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:29,330
Be careful.

61
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,814
Things might get ugly.

62
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:33,960
That message from Peckham
still troubles me.

63
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:40,220
I know, but we kept going
anyway, so no regrets.

64
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,737
We're counting on you.

65
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:43,740
Have fun storming the castle!

66
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:45,320
You got this!

67
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,980
Okay, let's move.

68
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,000
Depth, 15 meters.

69
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:30,120
Visibility, good.

70
00:04:35,140 --> 00:04:36,960
This is going well.

71
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:43,601
If we follow the river, we'll make
it straight to Big Mom's castle.

72
00:04:44,140 --> 00:04:46,200
I hope the waters stay deep.

73
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:47,600
We'll make do.

74
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,500
Yeah, we made it!

75
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,940
Big Mom, you can't stop us now!

76
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:20,420
I smell an adventure!

77
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:21,837
We don't need one.

78
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:24,567
Let's just find Sanji,
then wait on the boat.

79
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,860
Hey! Sanji! Pudding!

80
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,680
We made it!

81
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:32,480
Just like you told us!

82
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,680
Stop shouting!

83
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:36,411
What if the enemy's here?

84
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:37,880
This is weird.

85
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:39,997
You said Sanji was just standing there?

86
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,380
You're sure? Uh, yeah.

87
00:05:41,620 --> 00:05:43,160
I think I know Sanji.

88
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:47,594
Maybe he ran away, because I didn't
see him when I looked a second later.

89
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:49,820
Oh, wow!

90
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:52,037
Now we've got to eat the ground!

91
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:54,540
It's whipped cream only hard! Huh?

92
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,480
Um, you're right.

93
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,132
It tastes like meringue.

94
00:06:01,300 --> 00:06:04,320
So this island is all candy, too? What?

95
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:06,440
I want to live here!

96
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:10,080
This was the spot!

97
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:14,197
Sanji was standing right
up here with Pudding, too.

98
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:17,857
But I looked away for just a
second, and then they were gone.

99
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:21,517
Well, this is definitely the coast
where Pudding told us to meet her.

100
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,577
I know you wouldn't lie about this,

101
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:27,237
but I don't know why they would
run off as soon as they spotted us.

102
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:29,960
I was so excited to see him, but now what?

103
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:34,890
What's up?

104
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:45,400
Hey! It's him!

105
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:48,670
Saji!

106
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,960
Saji! Huh?

107
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:58,240
Come back!

108
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:01,040
What happened? Wait!

109
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:03,280
Is he here?

110
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,300
He was, but he ran off!

111
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,280
Maybe he's playing a game!

112
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:08,990
Really?

113
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:22,050
Sanji!

114
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,180
Hey, wait! Where'd he go?

115
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,640
We lost him!

116
00:07:32,940 --> 00:07:35,057
But this place sure looks delicious!

117
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:37,180
It's a forest of candies!

118
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,940
It smells good, too!

119
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:43,468
If all three of them saw him,
then he must be here somewhere.

120
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:48,271
But why would he run to the
forest without saying anything?

121
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,635
Did something happen?

122
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:52,580
I want you all to know this.

123
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:56,718
I never meant to hide anything
from my friends, okay?

124
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,440
I don't know.

125
00:07:59,740 --> 00:08:01,387
Maybe he's just embarrassed.

126
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:04,697
Hey! Sanji!

127
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,200
Come on out!

128
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:11,440
We're here to pick you up! Sanji!

129
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:22,120
Okay, let's split up and search!

130
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,300
I'm going for the cakes!

131
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:26,246
We're searching by the cakes!

132
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:30,958
I'm going straight, straight to where
that awesome-looking caramel is!

133
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,437
Then I'm going to the jelly beans!

134
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:36,226
That looks like a good
place for Sanji, right?

135
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:37,857
No, you don't!

136
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:39,234
You'll get lost again!

137
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,140
Aw, come on!

138
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,677
It couldn't have gone that far!

139
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,597
Besides, what else are we supposed to do?

140
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:47,597
You're talking like people who are
about to get lost in the woods.

141
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:48,510
Besides,

142
00:08:48,593 --> 00:08:52,671
it seems you're motivated by something
other than your desire to find Sanji.

143
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:54,140
What do you mean?

144
00:08:56,420 --> 00:09:00,677
I promise, you're awful liars, okay?

145
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,917
Fine, let's all search together.

146
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:07,417
You can have snacks, but you can't
wander off on your own. Got it.

147
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:09,260
It's a deal!

148
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:19,840
I could smell this
caramel from a mile away.

149
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:29,560
It really sticks to your
teeth, but it's so good!

150
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:32,440
I've never been so happy.

151
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,050
Hey, guys.

152
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,146
Remember Sanji, our Gourmet?

153
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:44,694
You know, the one we're here to rescue?

154
00:09:45,380 --> 00:09:48,537
If you keep stopping to munch
on the forest every two seconds,

155
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:50,597
we're never gonna get anything done.

156
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,897
Yeah, I get that.

157
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:54,340
But there's awesome desserts everywhere!

158
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:56,197
What are we supposed to do?

159
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,820
We're in enemy territory!

160
00:09:58,140 --> 00:10:00,434
Food or not, it's no time for a picnic!

161
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,197
Let's search a little more.

162
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:07,197
But if we don't find Sanji soon, then
we're all headed back to the boat.

163
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,110
What?!

164
00:10:08,193 --> 00:10:09,300
That's not fair!

165
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:14,996
Tell me you're late!

166
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,617
The river is smelling juice!

167
00:10:16,700 --> 00:10:17,560
Let me try!

168
00:10:18,540 --> 00:10:21,620
Did you, Tia, notice the
bridge is a giant donut?

169
00:10:22,380 --> 00:10:23,792
Okay, you've had enough.

170
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:25,626
I think it's time we move on.

171
00:10:32,660 --> 00:10:34,280
To the other side!

172
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:40,290
Mommy!

173
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:53,620
A crocodile!

174
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,080
Wanna fight? Let's go!

175
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,560
Hold on.

176
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:07,140
Too bad. Just humans.

177
00:11:17,500 --> 00:11:18,330
What?

178
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,157
We are good enough for you to eat!

179
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,070
Who cares?

180
00:11:21,153 --> 00:11:24,717
The issue here is that we've got
a talking crocodile wearing a hat.

181
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:27,600
I knew this place was dangerous and weird.

182
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:31,720
But we've got talking
animals with hats right here.

183
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:36,040
Come on, you know what I mean.

184
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,150
Let's go back.

185
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,320
I trust Pudding.

186
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,257
She hasn't led us wrong so far.

187
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:59,157
If we wait by the coast,
she'll bring Sanji to us.

188
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,257
And look at the bridge.

189
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:02,105
It's only going to get harder.

190
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:03,640
We'll be fine.

191
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:05,017
The river's not all that big.

192
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,000
I can jump it.

193
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:25,700
Oh, why is there another Luffy?

194
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:29,720
Who the heck are you?

195
00:12:35,820 --> 00:12:37,600
What do you mean, who am I?

196
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,260
I'm Luffy, you big creep!

197
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:40,481
What's going on?

198
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,680
Two Luffies?

199
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:43,040
Which one is real?

200
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,197
They move and talk exactly the same!

201
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:46,700
No, look, not exactly.

202
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:54,578
It's like he's Luffy's mirror image.

203
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:59,288
His scar is backwards, and his accessories
and stuff are on the opposite side.

204
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,550
You're right.

205
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:03,209
It's just like there's
an invisible mirror.

206
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,160
Hey, who are you?

207
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:07,260
Now me ask you a question.

208
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:09,009
Now you better answer her.

209
00:13:13,180 --> 00:13:14,080
It's Sochi.

210
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:15,437
He's right over there.

211
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:16,350
Huh?

212
00:13:16,460 --> 00:13:18,040
Look, up in the tree.

213
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:22,940
Hey! Sanji!

214
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,340
Move it!

215
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:28,380
I hate you!

216
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:30,137
What are you doing up there?

217
00:13:30,220 --> 00:13:31,050
Say something!

218
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:34,240
He's running again!

219
00:13:34,420 --> 00:13:35,440
Get back here!

220
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:40,160
Get out of my way! Faster!

221
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,900
Don't worry about me!

222
00:13:48,060 --> 00:13:49,707
You guys gotta follow Sanji!

223
00:13:50,380 --> 00:13:52,400
Okay, I'm coming too!

224
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:55,440
Follow the path and do not get separated!

225
00:13:55,860 --> 00:13:59,897
The forest is dangerous, so if it starts
to get weird, turn back and get out!

226
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:03,577
I'll try to be careful, but I'm
worried we might lose Sanji again!

227
00:14:03,660 --> 00:14:04,490
Sanji!

228
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:06,720
Nami, go with them!

229
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:10,160
I'll catch up with you
after I kick this guy's ass!

230
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:11,160
You got it.

231
00:14:20,760 --> 00:14:21,590
Sanji!

232
00:14:21,673 --> 00:14:23,458
Stop running away from your friends!

233
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,957
All right, come, come!

234
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:48,100
Mom, tell me, no!

235
00:14:57,260 --> 00:15:00,020
Do it, I'm so sick of you!

236
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,640
What is happening?

237
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:30,180
There's a giant buried in the ground!

238
00:15:30,420 --> 00:15:31,460
He's huge!

239
00:15:34,420 --> 00:15:36,100
You startled me.

240
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,760
That's our line.

241
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:39,660
Are you OK, mister?

242
00:15:39,920 --> 00:15:41,380
Who did this to you?

243
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,430
What?

244
00:15:43,513 --> 00:15:45,097
You're buried in the ground.

245
00:15:45,180 --> 00:15:46,260
That's bad.

246
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:47,880
It's fine.

247
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,660
I want to be buried.

248
00:15:50,180 --> 00:15:51,010
What?

249
00:15:51,093 --> 00:15:52,237
Will you quit messing around?

250
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,026
I am just trying to help you.

251
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:58,740
Actually, I'd like some juice.

252
00:15:59,180 --> 00:16:00,239
You're ridiculous.

253
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:06,912
Don't take him seriously, Chopper, or
you'll end up just as crazy as he is.

254
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:10,480
Wait. Hey, wait.

255
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:11,680
You guys.

256
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:12,917
He has something to say.

257
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,620
Ignore him.

258
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:20,200
By the way, my favorite
is apple juice. So what?

259
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:21,720
Just keep running.

260
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:26,840
If you turn left there, you'll
find some apple juice waterfalls.

261
00:16:27,940 --> 00:16:29,920
Those are the best.

262
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:32,102
We can't lose sight of the plan.

263
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:34,162
We're just here to rescue Sanji.

264
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:38,560
This is like a fever dream.

265
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:41,837
You're looking for someone, aren't you?

266
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:45,580
He came this way just a
second ago. What? Really?

267
00:16:46,260 --> 00:16:48,820
Chopper, I told you, we got to ignore him.

268
00:16:49,460 --> 00:16:53,620
I can tell you all about what
happened if you bring me some juice.

269
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,600
